    "detailed_description": "Embark on a precarious journey within the hostile world of Ronin Rush. With a wit as razor-sharp as his blade, our hero sets forth on a journey to defeat the ever-growing invasion of evil yokai and malevolent spirits. Kunai and weapon skills at the ready, RUSH into battle along side your elemental spirit companion.<br><br><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced, combat driven gameplay.<br></li><li>A vibrant procedural pixel world set in feudal Japan.<br></li><li>Unique worlds brimming with new mechanics and personality.<br></li><li>Various challenges for both grasshoppers and seasoned gamers alike.<br></li><li>Many special abilities and samurai skills to unlock.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726440/extras/44c6008c5f920c6ccfcc9f5d16923dfa.avif?t=1727204510\" width=600 height=125 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726440/extras/961186c2f4ca2c49b528430e705997e2.poster.avif?t=1727204510\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726440/extras/961186c2f4ca2c49b528430e705997e2.webm?t=1727204510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726440/extras/961186c2f4ca2c49b528430e705997e2.mp4?t=1727204510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726440/extras/f9e3f92b8c8866cf1d5e1192a59adc75.avif?t=1727204510\" width=600 height=125 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726440/ex